# Harness racing pipeline — environment configuration
#
# This pipeline needs NO secrets to run:
#  - It writes to a local SQLite file (data/harness.db), not a remote DB.
#  - In GitHub Actions, the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN handles the git push and
#    the database release asset — you do not create or paste any token.
#
# Optional overrides (leave unset to use defaults):
# TZ=Australia/Melbourne
